4. DOCKER COMMANDS 

To run the full application (Backend API + Frontend React UI) using Docker Compose:

    1. Navigate to the root directory containing `docker-compose.yml`:
    cd /path/to/project

    2. Build and start the containers:
    docker-compose up --build

    3. Access the application:
    - Frontend React App:  http://localhost:5173
    - Backend Express API: http://localhost:3000/api/posts

    4. To stop the running containers:
    docker-compose down

